00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:10.820
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.060
Eh?

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:14.800
But, among everything that Amano has made till now...

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:16.860
closed captions

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.120
...this is the most delicious.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.410
Did you just say delicious?

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:20.400
Y-Yeah.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.660
Really? You're not just thinking that it's ordinary or something?

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.330
I'm honestly praising you!

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.150
He rarely praises people, so he's embarrassed.

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:32.690
I did it! Thank you, Kashino.

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:37.170
Though I'm still far from being like everyone else, but at least I'm being acknowledged a little.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.740
I won't acknowledge you though.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:39.350
Eh?

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:41.290
That childish cake..

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:42.850
Hey, Choco...

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:45.020
T-That is, it can't be...

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:52.360
Amano Ichigo, how dare you get conceited just because you've been praised by Kashino!?

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:56.450
Kashino has a Sweets Spirit helping him out?

