00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:28.910
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:28.910
#Wasurenai@irc.rizon.net

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:36.410
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:45.240
In the first place, why are you in A-group?

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:46.850
I can't accept that.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:49.120
Even though you say that...

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:51.320
Eh? Ichigo-chan?

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:56.100
Amano, d-don't tell me you can see them?

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:57.390
Yeah.

00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:00.030
Choco, enough of that already!

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:06.530
Ichigo-chan has a Sweets Spirit with her, too.

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:08.270
Eh? Yeah.

00:03:08.570 --> 00:03:09.370
Huh!

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:11.720
Ichigo-chan too! That means...

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:20.220
It's fine. Other people can't see them.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.030
Eh?

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:24.350
Only those with Sweets Spirits can see them.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:27.860
Hanabusa-kun, Andouu-kun.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:32.910
In other words, those two also have Sweets Spirits...

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:39.360
recipe 6

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:39.360
Birthday party at Piyo Piyo Kindergarten

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:44.570
This girl is Vanilla. I met her in this cooking room on the day I transferred.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:48.970
This is Choco. A year ago, I guess I also met her here...

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:52.560
Ehhh...we're like playing with dolls. How embarrassing.

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:54.200
Failure duo!

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.350
Career pair!

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:57.470
How dare you talk back!

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:59.090
So what, you're just Choco after all!

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:01.080
Stop that, both of you!

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:02.080
Stop please!

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:04.040
Please don't fight!

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.270
It hurts...

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:14.980
Are you alright?

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.980
Geez, it can't be helped.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:20.190
She's my partner, Caramel.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:23.200
G-Good evening.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.220
How cute!

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:28.200
I like the rest of them, are from the same class in the spirit realm.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:32.110
Even back there, Vanilla and Choco often fought.

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:33.550
He's Cafe-kun.

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:35.210
Bonsoir, Ichigo.

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:36.790
Pleased to meet you.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:39.420
Everyone has Spirits with them as well.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:46.140
This academy is connected with the Spirit realm in some places. We are over here for training.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.390
I know that.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:51.320
To pair up with a human and practice making sweets together, right?

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:53.150
For the sake of becoming the royal palace pâtissier.

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:55.640
Royal palace pâtissier!!

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:59.250
Everyone really does want to be a pâtissier.

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.650
That goes for us too, right?

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:08.830
Come to think of it, Andouu-kun's dream is to open a Japanese and European mixed branch shop next to your family's Japanese confectionery, right?

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:14.830
I am aiming to work with my mother who's in flower arrangement, as coordinators for food, clothing and residences.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:20.070
I will definitely be a first class pâtissier and have an outstanding shop.

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:23.840
That is why I must graduate as the best from here.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.730
I see.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:30.210
Everyone has their own aspirations.

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:35.310
Compared with that, I only have my love for sweets.

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:46.160
My admiration for Henri-sensei's cake, my desire to make the strawberry tart grandma makes that always made me smile when I cried,

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.400
and I am here merely for those reasons...

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:52.760
Somehow, that seems to be in a completely different level from true aspirations...

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:55.530
Am I just... dreaming?

00:05:56.370 --> 00:06:01.010
Well then, now that we're done with the introductions. This is a little belated but...

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:09.170
Let's have a welcome party for Ichigo-chan and Vanilla.

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:12.600
Everyone prepared this together.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:16.790
These marzipan dolls and rose candy is made by Hanabasa-kun, right?

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:17.600
You guessed it right.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.000
This chocolate swirl form is Kashino's.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.430
Yeah. Since it's still impossible for you to make.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:25.480
And this mochi looking thing is...

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.650
It's a Turkish delight with Japanese confectionery touches.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:29.820
It's made with fresh cream and strawberry.

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:33.290
Everyone presented their special qualities.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.290
This is petit four, right?

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.730
Yes, you really know a lot about it.

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:47.010
It's a French bakery's strawberry shortcake.

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:57.430
Compared with Japanese shortcakes, it has its own poetic culture. It feels like I'm standing in a field of wild strawberries.

00:06:58.070 --> 00:07:02.230
Nevertheless, how did you make these marzipan so well?

00:06:58.070 --> 00:07:01.150
This look delicious, come here Vanilla.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:02.230
They look so real.

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:06.320
Have you heard of the phrase, an artisan steals by sight.

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:10.450
In the future, whichever pâtisserie you go to...

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:11.960
Pâtisserie?

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:14.020
He means cake shops.

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:14.620
Oh!

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:21.620
Nobody will kindly teach everything, newcomers have to steal the skills by watching their senpai.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:25.110
Ehh... is that the way it is?

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:26.330
Just kidding.

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:30.340
This is an academy, and Ichigo-chan's so cute, so I'll teach you anything you want.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:34.350
Do you know, different people has different focuses.

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:33.450
I can't keep up with his personality.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:34.340
I agree as well.

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:36.620
In my case, it's design.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:39.850
To portray the shape I want, I have to redraw it countless times.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:45.060
Taking flower arrangement in class also gives us decorating ideas.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.900
Design and flower arrangement.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:52.060
He's already so good at everything and still puts in so much effort.

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:54.070
I've to try my best, too.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:57.070
I'll try crafting something with marzipan as well.

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:59.290
Vanilla, will you model for me?

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:00.580
Yes.

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:11.280
Ichigo-chan, see the whole picture clearly.

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:16.330
Hey, Vanilla. You're a model so stand still, please.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:18.310
You've made it quite cute.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:25.760
Vanilla is not such an ugly girl!

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:28.520
This is the first time I'm doing this, it can't be helped, right?

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.820
This is horrible.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.820
It resembles Ichigo-chan herself though!

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:32.190
It resembles you.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:36.910
It's strange, with Amano, you'd just want to teach her.

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:41.620
Like pouring water in sand. It will just keep absorbing the water, making it interesting.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:46.660
This might be due to the idiotic personality she's blessed with.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:48.130
Just be frank with your comments...

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:58.330
She came in after us, but what an eyesore, that Amano Ichigo.

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:01.330
And she can't even make any satisfactory sweets at all.

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:04.560
But, she's surrounded by the Sweets Princes.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.170
And somehow they seem to be having fun.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:17.640
Birthday cake for Piyo Piyo Kindergarten. For this operation, Groups A, B and C will be in charge of the kindergarten pupils, huh...

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:20.580
Ichigo-chan, is this your first time doing voluntary work?

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.360
Yes, and it seems fun.

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:23.870
I like children.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.400
No, no... You can't be naïve about this.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.380
Cakes are tough to handle already.

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:30.730
Tough... Cake?

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:48.060
Everyone... Students from St. Marie Academy are here!

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:51.400
Snacks! Snacks!

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.360
Andou, let's play!

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.360
Hey, hey...

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.470
Satsuki-kun over here.

00:09:55.770 --> 00:09:56.970
Alright, alright...

00:09:56.970 --> 00:09:58.420
Rumi-chan...

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:00.620
Don't rush, it'll break.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:02.920
Kashino, hurry up and get in.

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:03.790
You, too.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:06.210
Kashino, give us chocolates!

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:09.180
Y-You brats...!

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:10.460
Kashino.

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:13.110
What are you doing? That's so immature.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:15.980
Now, now...

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:21.030
It was strawberry prints.

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:22.970
That's quite childish.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:26.800
Brats... Hey you brats!!!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:27.480
Now, now.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:31.480
It's Hitomi-chan, Hiro-kun and Mayu-chan's birthdays this month.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:34.480
Alright. It's a day late, but here Hitomi-chan, for you.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:37.490
It's C group's Cherry Cake.

00:10:39.550 --> 00:10:43.660
It's a day early, but for Hiro-kun B group made, Hero cake.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.160
Wow, Space Mask!

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:51.170
And for Mayu-chan, as requested, A-group made you a princess cake.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:53.380
Wow, it's cute.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:56.210
Thank you everyone from St. Marie Academy.

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:57.940
Thank you!

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:00.100
Itadakimasu!

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:04.900
Everyone seems so pleased.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:07.740
It's important to watch the reaction of those eating as well.

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:08.590
I see!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:14.220
Why is only that girl all alone?

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:19.390
Ringo, you shouldn't do this.
Why aren't you eating with the rest of them?

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:22.310
I'm alright alone.

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:26.120
Being that way, you'll never be able to make friends.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.950
That girl is Koizumi-san's little sister, Ringo-chan.

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:41.020
Is Koizumi-san's home near here?

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:45.460
Yes. Koizumi-san was staying at the dorms alone when she first got in the academy, but...

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:49.500
...Ringo-chan and her family moved here from Aomori last month.

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:51.640
Oh... Is that so?

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:56.150
Ringo-chan is extremely quiet so it's quite hard to befriend her.

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:04.660
Ringo-chan. Do you want a cookie?

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:06.790
It's a strawberry.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:09.550
I'm called Amano Ichigo.

00:12:09.650 --> 00:12:12.160
We both have fruit names, right?

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:15.880
Strawberry panties and apple cheeks are getting along!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.050
Yay, fruits!

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:21.100
Who is strawberry panties?!

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.010
Aaah! Run away!

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:34.810
Ringo-chan?

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:43.610
I was transferred here too in order to learn how to make cakes.

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:45.440
Eh, is that so?

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:47.200
It's the same as Jinno-oneechan.

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:49.420
Do you like cakes, Ringo-chan?

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:56.920
You didn't eat the birthday cake at all, so I thought maybe you hated cakes.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.090
No.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:02.240
Right. When is your birthday, Ringo-chan?

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:03.370
Next month.

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:04.420
I see.

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:07.590
I'll make you a birthday cake then.

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.430
So, what kind of cakes do you like?

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:13.530
A cake with apples and lots of fresh cream.

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:20.880
You know, in my previous kindergarten, we made snowmen when it snowed.

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:25.820
And after that, Sensei made us an apple cake.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.380
It was really delicious.

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:29.880
It was like this.

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:32.830
I'll make a cake like that then.

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:36.830
But, I can't eat it together with everyone else.

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:39.720
They'll keep teasing and call me apple cheeks.

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:42.550
Ah.. that's what it was.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:47.590
You feel a little lost at a new school, even the slightest thing can be depressing.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:51.550
Amano, how could you promise without due consideration?

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:54.960
What exactly is a cake that can help everyone get along?

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:57.310
Ichigo-chan, do you have an idea?

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:05.530
Umm... well, can I design Ringo-chan's cake?

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:09.120
Of course. It's best when the person who wants to do it makes it.

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:12.410
Thank you. I'll think of an exciting cake.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.780
Oh, you really are inspired to do this.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:21.930
That's because Ringo-chan is like me, when I first came to St. Marie.

00:14:21.930 --> 00:14:23.480
I can't leave her alone.

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:32.400
An exciting cake made with apples and fresh cream is...

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:34.560
What should I do?

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:36.500
Fresh cream.

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:38.890
White.

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:40.510
Friends.

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:43.570
Yellow Mellon...

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.300
...you got fresh cream on your face...

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:50.090
Cafe, carry the eggs.

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:54.520
When we're together you get nose bleeds, don't you?

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:57.580
Hurry up and carry them.

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:01.880
She's baking a cake with everyone.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.590
It's fun to have friends after all.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:07.010
I got it.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:22.100
Ringo-chan is still all alone.

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:27.680
Sensei, there's a suspicious person here!

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.280
Suspicious person?!

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:31.280
Oh no...

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:36.120
H-How is this?

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.400
I want to eat it.

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:48.300
H-How is this?

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:50.890
It's cute.

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:52.800
Is it a snow park?

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.500
The students and apple tress will be made of marzipan.

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:59.310
The snow dome will be apples covered in fresh cream.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:01.810
Ah... that will be my specialty.

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:05.230
Snowmen will be white chocolate filled with custard.

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:07.810
And white apple will be filled with custard cream.

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:09.830
That's my task, right?

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.680
This seems fun, doesn't it?

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:14.530
You've captured kindergarten students traits very well.

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:22.540
Umm... as practice, could we try making this cake tonight?

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.040
Of course.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.830
It's that girl again.

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.460
Really, she gets on my nerves.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:30.880
I just had an idea.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:39.410
Will her design be alright?

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.650
Of course, it'll defintely be alright.

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:44.830
Thinking of Ringo-chan, she spent sleepless nights planning it.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:48.260
What would you know, Vanilla? You were just snoring away.

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:51.990
T-That may be true. But when Ichigo is hyped up, she gets things done!

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.790
I wonder about that.

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:55.090
What did you say?

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:56.030
Do you want to go at it?

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:57.530
Now, now...

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:59.120
Don't fight!

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.870
Be careful with that.

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:01.760
Okay.

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:05.880
I hope Ringo-chan will be pleased with this cake.

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:08.340
And I hope she'll get along with everyone.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:15.540
Phew... It takes a lot of effort to make all this.

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:17.710
But it turned out really well.

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:21.040
Shall we go to the store?

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:22.700
I'll come.

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.060
Vanilla will come along, too.

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:26.990
Caramel will stay behind to keep watch.

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:28.860
We'll leave you to keep watch then.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:33.330
Good evening. I'm Caramel.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.750
They've all gone out.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.370
It's this cake.

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:44.580
Yay, a photo shoot. Do take my picture please!

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:52.480
Hmpf, it's nothing special really. Amano Ichigo's design.

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:55.060
She can only feel good about it for now.

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:58.010
We'll embarrass you on the day you deliver it.

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:05.980
The store's meat buns are really delicious!

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.550
It's a new cafe latte. Want some?

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:11.960
Let me see.

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:16.110
I bought a lot of newly made candy.

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:17.640
Did you buy that many?

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:20.850
Can't you wait till we get back to the cooking room?

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:22.930
Really. How vulgar.

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:25.220
You have some, too.

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:26.200
I'm hurting...

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:28.970
Somehow, this feels strange.

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:36.630
Just a short while ago, I was in a normal middle school and I only got to eat sweets that Mama made.

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:42.390
And now I'm making sweets with friends here...

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:46.700
It's finally today.

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:48.230
The birthday party.

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.940
I wonder if Ringo-chan is waiting for it, too.

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:55.440
Yup. The marzipan and the dome has been made. All that's left is to decorate it.

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:59.450
We've practiced so many times that we can do this blindfolded.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:06.830
Eh?

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:10.500
Wait... that cake is ours.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:11.990
Huh!?

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:15.710
It's exactly like the one I thought up.

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:18.370
Please don't say such weird things...

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:19.990
It's my design.

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:22.930
You copied from her didn't you, Amano-san?

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:25.810
No way...

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:27.420
That's not it.

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:30.640
For Ringo-chan's sake, I thought so hard...

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:34.030
Ah... but she's on the 15th seat, isn't she?

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:39.420
Thank goodness. Ayu-chan's 4th seat, so I'll get to display mine first.

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:42.370
Being presented with the same cake will be disappointing, won't it.

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:44.870
She'll be teased for copying.

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:49.240
Ah! Copy cat!

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:55.650
Those people, why?

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:02.550
She's one to speak, when they're the ones who stole the design.

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:06.050
We made it at night, so they might have seen it at some point.

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:11.060
Everyone believed me.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:13.910
Umm... I'm sorry.

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:17.190
Those girls had taken pictures of the cake.

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:23.070
I thought it was wonderful. And I forgot to tell you about this!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.030
Geez, you're a real idiot, Caramel.

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:30.020
It's pointless to say that now...

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:32.590
But, but...

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:37.330
It's alright, you don't have to cry.
Those girls are the ones at fault.

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:40.090
Unforgivable.

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:43.810
A cake made to cheer the girl up, saddened her instead.

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.630
The birthday party is at 12 noon.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:49.850
We must change the design in an hour.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:54.440
But, how do we do it?

00:20:57.710 --> 00:21:02.490
A cake that'll make Ringo-chan happy
and help her get along with everyone...

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:06.370
On a cold snowy day, getting along with everyone...

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:09.980
Ah! That's it!

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:11.870
I got an even better design!

