00:23:35.370 --> 00:23:39.000
I want to quickly become a pâtissière like that, too.

00:23:47.840 --> 00:23:49.490
Wow, amazing!

00:23:53.040 --> 00:23:54.190
It's done!

00:23:54.190 --> 00:23:55.550
Looks delicious.

00:24:00.660 --> 00:24:04.130
The cake design that I though up for Ringo-chan was stolen!

00:24:04.130 --> 00:24:05.790
Eh? What do I do!?

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:08.610
We have only an hour to change the design.

00:24:08.610 --> 00:24:10.910
Everyone, please help out.

00:24:10.910 --> 00:24:15.410
Just like grandma's cake, I want to bring Ringo-chan's smile back.

00:24:15.410 --> 00:24:17.570
Wait for me, Ringo-chan!

00:24:17.570 --> 00:24:22.550
But, those people can make such a delicious cake though. So why, then?

00:24:22.550 --> 00:24:25.380
Next episode, Buddies Birthday Cake.

00:24:25.380 --> 00:24:28.180
Do you want to eat my dream-coloured sweets?

